{"data":{"body":"[P2] Bind each child wait segment to its invocation phase. Both wait-parent assertions constrain only the child execution ARN. Consequently, STARTED and SUCCEEDED wait spans both parented and timed within the second child Invocation still pass, even though the initial invocation has no wait segment. Add `$occurrence: 1` to the STARTED segment's parent and `$occurrence: 2` to the SUCCEEDED segment's parent, with a regression test placing both segments inside the same child invocation.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABBC2WuA","finding_digest":"6577632ea5b98745350a677088764d9912f1be239951fe65b9f147dccd69e957","finding_id":"arf_v1_mv3wglvfxgduknikm5yiq5snte","finding_key":"otel-invocation-27::child-wait-parent::invocation-phase-correlation","identity_key":"otel-invocation-27::child-wait-parent::invocation-phase-correlation","line":279,"observation_digest":"54ac61bafb040e91b4525561b4a880617b28cdc0274bb52a6eb376f32a84d46e","observation_id":"aro_v1_kswgdox3aqhjdncskvq3jkeamf","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/test-requirements/otel-invocation/otel-invocation-27.yaml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-23T23:29:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_sh4u6uxcczxmxehee4hbsigolv","reviewed_base_sha":"fac2fef2ba9456e6000d57556c8a22266d191c47","reviewed_head_sha":"a13cfd946d2f9a169533ee7b96bdb67d161bc979","reviewer":"codex","start_line":275,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_fe62k5bx4vdst3xipvassl36b5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-23T23:29:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
